<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c3">Best in Slot Gear for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>In Dragon Soul, we are switching our best profession from Jewelcrafting to Blacksmithing, this is since Epic Gems is introduced, and gives BS a higher stat bonus.<br/>
<br/>As a Beast Mastery Hunter your first goal as always is reaching your hit cap. Luckily a lot of best in slot  gear has plenty of hit so you should have no issues at all reaching the hit cap of 961 rating. Also with Cataclysm and the reforging system it is easier than ever. <br/>
