<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Beast Mastery Hunter  Phase 4</h3>In Dragon Soul, we can't buy Tier with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> anymore.<br/>
<br/>This means we can safely use our Valor Points to purchase items where we lack them the most instead of purchasing them in a particular order.<br/>Your first big purchase is likely <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77111/emergency-descent-loop">
<img alt="Emergency Descent Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_89.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emergency Descent Loop</span></a> the first week, however <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77091/cameo-of-terrible-memories">
<img alt="Cameo of Terrible Memories" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cameo of Terrible Memories</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77095/batwing-cloak">
<img alt="Batwing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Batwing Cloak</span></a> could be a good options as well depending on what items you have from Firelands already.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77175/boneshard-boots">
