<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Head for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the helm slot there is only one item you should aim for and that is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78698/wyrmstalkers-headguard">
